<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Vierter Auftritt</hi>.</hi></head><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#c">Blanka. Caecilia.</hi></stage><lb/>
<sp who="#CAE"><speaker>Caecilia.</speaker> <p>Du hier, Blanka!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#BLA"><speaker>Blanka.</speaker> <p>Laß mich, laß mich! bi&#x017F;t Du<lb/>
